    "detailed_description": "&quot;Show Me How to Live&quot; is a minimalist aesthetic shoot 'em up game, in which we control a ship that must navigate and understand the perspective of a person capable of seeing the senselessness of life but unable to do anything about it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith simple mechanics and high difficulty, &quot;Teach Me How to Live&quot; offers a brief but intense journey not suitable for everyone.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDesigned and developed by a single person, with the aim of showcasing a gloomy way of viewing life.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2014 Play and discover how someone who can't find meaning in life sees it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2014 Test yourself against the most challenging enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2014 Demonstrate your skill during 6 intense chapters.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2014 Discover yourself as you navigate through an intense narrative that will give you much to ponder.",
